    obtain ⟨z,w,H₁⟩:= aboveR P₀ A X B T Z V U W F hp hX hc E M₀ he Y hh C Ht O L1 hC Θ Uv i0 Gn ξ Ξ (Lx-v) Pz a Δφ Jp t γ (Xc+ω') hAq hG hM₀ hP hPt hPk hTol hU hδ hqκ hp' hQP
